  "whats_new_workspace_title": "New workspace",
  "whats_new_workspace_body": "<b>Photo, Video, Text</b> are now in the top switcher. The mode filters the queue, file picker, folder import, and relevant settings.",
  "whats_new_preview_title": "Large center preview",
  "whats_new_preview_body": "When a photo, video, or text file is selected, it opens larger in the center area. From there you can save a format, convert one file, or jump to editing.",
  "whats_new_text_title": "Text file conversion",
  "whats_new_text_body": "Added support for <b>txt, md, html, json, csv, tsv, rtf, pdf, docx, doc, odt, xlsx, xls, ods, pptx, ppt, odp</b>. Text tasks can run without FFmpeg when the queue has no media files.",
  "whats_new_ui_title": "Logo and inputs",
  "whats_new_ui_body": "Updated the app logo, window icon, and top header. Inputs, dropdowns, numeric fields, and language controls are better aligned and handle long values.",
  "whats_new_ebooks_title": "E-Books & Audiobooks",
  "whats_new_ebooks_body": "Full support for <b>EPUB, FB2, MOBI</b>: structural reading, conversion to PDF, DOCX, TXT, and generating audiobooks (MP3, M4A, WAV) via system speech or FFmpeg synthesis.",
  "whats_new_ocr_title": "OCR Text Recognition from Scans",
  "whats_new_ocr_body": "Extract text from images (PNG, JPG, TIFF, WebP) and scanned PDFs without a text layer. Supports Tesseract CLI, EasyOCR, and built-in Otsu segmentation with export to TXT, DOCX, MD.",
  "whats_new_editor_title": "Visual Editing: Trim & Crop",
  "whats_new_editor_body": "Interactive timeline slider with dual In/Out markers for precise video & audio trimming, plus an interactive visual crop frame directly over the preview with rule-of-thirds grid.",
  "whats_new_merge_loudnorm_title": "Media Merge & EBU R128 Loudness",
  "whats_new_merge_loudnorm_body": "Fast concatenation for multiple audio & video files (Lossless Concat or transcode) and broadcast-grade two-pass EBU R128 audio loudness normalization.",
  "whats_new_apple_whisper_title": "Apple Silicon & Whisper Model Manager",
  "whats_new_apple_whisper_body": "VideoToolbox hardware acceleration (H.264, HEVC, ProRes) on macOS M1–M4. Built-in Whisper model manager modal dialog to inspect, download, delete models, and choose compute devices (MPS/CUDA/CPU).",
